item.description:
After helping power President Donald Trump’s two presidential wins, some GOP analysts are concerned the party is&nbsp;not doing enough to turn out White evangelical voters. We look what might keep them home and examine how some Democrats are leaning on their own faith journeys to try and win some of them back.&nbsp;

---&nbsp;

Guest: Lauren Fox, CNN Congressional Correspondent&nbsp;

Host: David Rind&nbsp;

Producer: Paola Ortiz&nbsp;

Showrunner: Felicia Patinkin
